      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per 10 minutes\n\n---\nEffect Brakknap touches a foe, making them experience the pain suffered by Chitterwood goblins during the Goblinblood Wars. The target takes 3d6 mental damage (DC 21 basic Will save save). A creature that fails the save is also Frightened 1 (Frightened 2 on a critical failure).",
